        {
          "generated_prob": 0.00007868645414406416,
          "sentence": "In section 3.2, you seem to imply that there are different settings of hypernetworks that allow to vary from an RNN to a CNN, this is not clear to me, maybe you could show how this would work on a simple temporal problem with equations.",
